#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Python"
msgstr "Instalação do Python"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:47
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are two package files whose name starts with the <quote>python</quote>"
" prefix. The one to extract from is <filename>Python-&python-"
"version;.tar.xz</filename> (notice the uppercase first letter)."
msgstr ""
"Existem dois arquivos de pacotes cujos nomes se iniciam com o prefixo "
"<quote>python</quote>. Aquele a se extrair a partir dele é "
"<filename>Python-&python-version;.tar.xz</filename> (perceba a primeira "
"letra maiúscula)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:53
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Python for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Python para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:55
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --enable-shared     \\\n"
"            --without-ensurepip \\\n"
"            --without-static-libpython</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --enable-shared     \\\n"
"            --without-ensurepip \\\n"
"            --without-static-libpython</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:61
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure option:"
msgstr "O significado da opção de configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:64
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:66
#, xml-text
msgid "This switch prevents installation of static libraries."
msgstr "Essa chave impede a instalação de bibliotecas estáticas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:71
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-ensurepip</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-ensurepip</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch disables the Python package installer, which is not needed at "
"this stage."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave desabilita o instalador de pacote do Python, o qual não é "
"necessário neste estágio."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-static-libpython</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-static-libpython</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid "This switch prevents building a large, but unneeded, static library."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave impede instalar uma biblioteca estática grande, porém "
"desnecessária."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:89
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some Python 3 modules can't be built now because the dependencies are not "
"installed yet. For the <filename>ssl</filename> module, a message "
"<computeroutput>Python requires a OpenSSL 1.1.1 or newer</computeroutput> is"
" outputted.  The message should be ignored.  Just make sure the toplevel "
"<command>make</command> command has not failed.  The optional modules are "
"not needed now and they will be built in <xref linkend=\"chapter-building-"
"system\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Alguns módulos do Python 3 não podem ser construídos agora, pois as "
"dependências não estão instaladas ainda. Para o módulo "
"<filename>ssl</filename>, uma mensagem <computeroutput>Python requires a "
"OpenSSL 1.1.1 or newer</computeroutput> é gerada. A mensagem deveria ser "
"ignorada. Apenas tenha certeza de que o comando de nível superior "
"<command>make</command> não tenha falhado. Os módulos opcionais não são "
"necessários agora e eles serão construídos no <xref linkend=\"chapter-"
"building-system\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/python.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Details on this package are located in <xref linkend=\"contents-python\" "
"role=\".\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Detalhes acerca deste pacote estão localizados na <xref linkend=\"contents-"
"python\" role=\".\"/>"
